# ZenRay Retopology, retopology editor : reuse it on any model (29 October 2026)

ZenRay Retopology is the finishing and retopology module of ZenRay Meshes. One document of curves (nodes, arcs as clamped cubic B-splines, named component seeds, options) goes through every stage : the six view reference sheet, then the 3D model as the source of truth, then each new version of the model, until the quad mesh is sent to Houdini. (29 October 2026)

