- Selection card : the title says what is selected, only the matching actions show ; Shift adds points, several points move together, Cmd D duplicates, Del deletes, the Magnet puts a released point on a point or a contour. (29 October 2026)
- Projects : `/api/projects` ; the car is `data/`, the others `projects/<id>/data/` ; the page opens `?project=<id>` or the last one ; a deleted project goes to `projects/_trash`. (29 October 2026)
